"quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-"
"outputs/9c020053-c369-4cc4-829e-72246d79f82c-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We perform the controlled unitary operations:\n"
msgstr "Wykonujemy kontrolowane operacje unitarne:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/quantum-phase-estimation/extracted-outputs/0b3bedfc-"
"be73-427d-9eed-22a2d7df60cd-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Wynik poprzedniej komórki kodu](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
