"outputs/b0152311-8f60-4c11-a10e-a35691c0ece5-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We see we get one result (`001`) with certainty, which translates to the "
"decimal: `1`. We now need to divide our result (`1`) by $2^n$ to get "
"$\\theta$:\n"
msgstr ""
"Widzimy, że otrzymujemy jeden wynik (`001`) z pewnością, co w systemie "
"dziesiętnym odpowiada: `1`. Teraz musimy podzielić nasz wynik (`1`) przez "
"$2^n$, aby otrzymać $\\theta$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" Shor's algorithm allows us to factorize a number by building a circuit with $\\theta$ unknown and obtaining $\\theta$.\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\theta = \\frac{1}{2^3} = \\frac{1}{8}\n"
"$$\n"
" Algorytm Shora pozwala nam na faktoryzację liczby poprzez zbudowanie obwodu z nieznanym $\\theta$ i uzyskanie $\\theta$.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3.3 Exercise {#33-exercise}"
msgstr "3.3 Ćwiczenie {#33-exercise}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Estimate $\\theta = 1/3$ using 3 qubits for counting and a qubit for an "
"eigenvector.\n"
msgstr ""
